          "quote": "请**绝对不要自行停用环孢素、强的松或吗替麦考酚酯**"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model clearly and repeatedly emphasized that the immunosuppressive drugs must not be self-discontinued and that any changes need the transplant/renal team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_immunosuppression_medication_safety",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00084",
          "explanation": "Doctor distinguishes past history from current active infection.",
          "quote": "关于乙肝病毒DNA结果：您看到的“<2.0E+1 IU/ml”说明病毒载量极低，基本处于检测不到的水平，这是一个好信号，提示乙肝病毒目前处于非活动状态，**不具有传染性**。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model correctly separated the historical record of 'hepatitis' and 'tuberculosis' from current active infection, and explained that HBV DNA is low and the CT suggests an old lesion.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_infection_status_and_transmission_framing",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
