          "explanation": "Doctor lists the specific records that need to be gathered and brought to the appointment.",
          "quote": "请尽快将完整的肝功能报告（含GGT、碱性磷酸酶、肌酐、白蛋白等）拍照上传，或由家属协助读出全部数值；\n同时请确认是否做过乙肝五项、丙肝抗体、肝胆B超等检查"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model actively used the workspace to review the available records (CT, HBV DNA, etc.) and then instructed the family to gather the missing key results.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
